  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request Path",
      "items": [
        "Ingress terminates HTTPS and forwards /laya to the gateway (httproute.yaml:26)",
        "The API key is checked before the extract handler runs (DocumentEndpoints.cs:49)",
        "Failures are thrown, not caught in the endpoints: one exception handler answers them (ProblemMapping.cs:22, ArchitectureTests.cs:172)",
        "The service sends back the model calls it made; the gateway records each as usage (DocumentExtractor.cs:56)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Every upload is streamed to ClamAV before any parser reads it; an infection is refused with 422 (DocumentPipeline.cs:50-55)",
        "Parsers run only in the document service, which has no egress (DocumentClassifier.cs:49, LocalPageRasterizer.cs:136-142)",
        "Only the extraction service holds the model key and reaches the internet; a test checks the gateway never mentions it (ArchitectureTests.cs:122)",
        "The gateway runs no model and carries no native library; a test checks its build (ArchitectureTests.cs:57)",
        "The three services accept calls only from the gateway; the decisions and document services may reach nothing (networkpolicy.yaml:6-128)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Usage and Telemetry",
      "items": [
        "Each model call is queued and written to a SQLite file; GET /api/usage serves it as JSON or CSV (UsageStore.cs:19, UsageEndpoints.cs:75)",
        "The collector alone holds the Honeycomb ingest key (collector-config.yaml:29)",
        "Production is not yet verified: the collector image and Honeycomb ingestion are untested"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not Shown",
      "items": [
        "Local dotnet run turns scanning off in appsettings.Development.json (line 13); Compose and Helm turn it on",
        "The analyze route dispatches to stub agents, not real downstream agents (Program.cs:34)",
        "The decisions service's telemetry and the other services' links to the collector are not all drawn",
        "The manual garak red-team harness and its CI job are not part of the runtime (redteam/)"
      ]
    }
  ]
